Implement management service for scoped reads and draft edits with full model/reference/grant/name/transform validation. Produce redacted diffs, tool-surface changes, affected upstreams, and supported-live versus restart-required changes. Separate pure validation from explicit connection probes so validation never imports/executes arbitrary hooks. Acceptance: malformed references, collisions, deletion semantics, secrets, and unauthorized settings covered; preview records exact base/candidate revision. Implementation/local evidence: docs/specs/remote-configuration-acceptance.md. Production and native-host verification remain separate release gates.
